			"notes": "### Now supports Minecraft version 26.2 and 26.3\n\n## Improvements\n+ Improved Hypixel mob detection in highlight feature. Now also highlights mobs with weirder hitboxes like Ant, pests, etc.\n+ Multiple options of highlighting: Outline/Filled/Filled with Outline, as well as extra color option for outline.\n+ Changed how shaft announcer message gets displayed if you are using the mod. Should be much cleaner as well as added option to click to warp message.\n\n## Removed\n- Removed options to disable re-swing and instant item swap from animations. (Temporary)\n- Removed line of sight toggle in highlight feature. (Didn't have much of a use since it didn't change anything from the users point).\n\n## Fixes\n+ Fixed abiphone feature working in the bits shop.\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Frostzie/SkyFall/compare/v2.3.0...v2.4.0"
		},
