			"notes": "## New Features\n- Favorite Contacts feature. Similar to favorite pets feature but for abiphone contacts.\n- Option to disable mob model for highlighted mobs.\n- Option to share shaft type as well as corpse type/amount in party chat when entering a mineshaft.\n\n## Improvements\n- Very slightly improved performance of favorite pets feature.\n- Moved favorite pets saving to main config file.\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Frostzie/SkyFall/compare/v2.2.0...v2.3.0"
